      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. thanks. lets get into the actual content for the first segment. i want to talk about how these \"experts\" and the mainstream media always seem to push the same narrative no matter what actually happens with the economy or even just how much life costs now. can you write a 2 minute monologue where the host calls out how the talking heads on news channels are totally out of touch with people's actual lives? make it punchy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
